WHY THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC AND STILL NOT OPEN SOURCE
-------------------------------------------------------
Being readable is not the same as being reusable. This repository is public so that the work can be seen; it is
not open source, and adding a permissive licence later would be easy while removing one would not.

CONTRIBUTIONS
-------------
CONTRIBUTING.md describes the standards a contribution would have to meet. Because no licence is granted, any
contribution can only be accepted under a separate written agreement assigning copyright in that contribution to
the copyright holder. Please open an issue to discuss before writing code, so that nobody spends an evening on
something that cannot be merged.

